      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VELOCITY YIN (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when eighth at Q Lakeside over 390m behind Aeration (23.15) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Should bounce back. CANYA CURRENCY (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (19.49) in a Mix 5 at this track. Form here sound including three wins. One of the main contenders. EASTLY BREEZE (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 8 lengths at Q Lakeside (22.63). Goes very well at course and distance boasting two wins. The form out of last race has been strong. Cannot be underestimated.",
